       "src": "May call p.11"
      },
      {
       "lead": "Profit is growing faster than cash:",
       "text": "five-year profit ₹270 Cr vs ₹215 Cr of operating cash, but FY26 alone converted only a quarter.",
       "src": null
      },
      {
       "lead": "Return on new capital (ROIIC): about 32%,",
       "text": "on a small base: capital employed rose ₹139 Cr from FY24 to FY26 while after-tax operating profit rose about ₹44 Cr.",
       "src": null
      }
